Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports: jsonlite, stats, utils
Suggests: lme4, lmerTest, MASS, survival, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
